{"suttaId":"sn35.113","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"S-iv","vriCode":"s0304m.mul","paras":[684,690],"vripara":"113"},"segments":{"sn35.113:0.3":"Upassutisuttaṃ","sn35.113:1.1":"Ekaṃ samayaṃ bhagavā nātike [ñātike (sī. syā. kaṃ.)] viharati giñjakāvasathe.","sn35.113:1.2":"Atha kho bhagavā rahogato paṭisallīno imaṃ dhammapariyāyaṃ abhāsi –","sn35.113:1.3":"“cakkhuñca paṭicca rūpe ca uppajjati cakkhuviññāṇaṃ. Tiṇṇaṃ saṅgati phasso.","sn35.113:1.4":"Phassapaccayā vedanā;","sn35.113:1.5":"vedanāpaccayā taṇhā;","sn35.113:1.6":"taṇhāpaccayā upādānaṃ;","sn35.113:1.7":"upādānapaccayā bhavo;","sn35.113:1.8":"bhavapaccayā jāti;","sn35.113:1.9":"jātipaccayā jarāmaraṇaṃ sokaparidevadukkhadomanassupāyāsā sambhavanti.","sn35.113:1.10":"Evametassa kevalassa dukkhakkhandhassa samudayo hoti.","sn35.113:1.11":"Jivhañca paṭicca rase ca uppajjati … pe … manañca paṭicca dhamme ca uppajjati manoviññāṇaṃ.","sn35.113:1.12":"Tiṇṇaṃ saṅgati phasso.","sn35.113:1.13":"Phassapaccayā vedanā;","sn35.113:1.14":"vedanāpaccayā taṇhā;","sn35.113:1.15":"taṇhāpaccayā upādānaṃ;","sn35.113:1.16":"upādānapaccayā bhavo;","sn35.113:1.17":"bhavapaccayā jāti;","sn35.113:1.18":"jātipaccayā jarāmaraṇaṃ sokaparidevadukkhadomanassupāyāsā sambhavanti.","sn35.113:1.19":"Evametassa kevalassa dukkhakkhandhassa samudayo hoti”.","sn35.113:2.1":"“Cakkhuñca paṭicca rūpe ca uppajjati cakkhuviññāṇaṃ. Tiṇṇaṃ saṅgati phasso.","sn35.113:2.2":"Phassapaccayā vedanā;","sn35.113:2.3":"vedanāpaccayā taṇhā.","sn35.113:2.4":"Tassāyeva taṇhāya asesavirāganirodhā upādānanirodho;","sn35.113:2.5":"upādānanirodhā bhavanirodho;","sn35.113:2.6":"bhavanirodhā jātinirodho;","sn35.113:2.7":"jātinirodhā jarāmaraṇaṃ sokaparidevadukkhadomanassupāyāsā nirujjhanti.","sn35.113:2.8":"Evametassa kevalassa dukkhakkhandhassa nirodho hoti … pe … jivhañca paṭicca rase ca uppajjati … pe … manañca paṭicca dhamme ca uppajjati manoviññāṇaṃ.","sn35.113:2.10":"Tiṇṇaṃ saṅgati phasso.","sn35.113:2.11":"Phassapaccayā vedanā;","sn35.113:2.12":"vedanāpaccayā taṇhā.","sn35.113:2.13":"Tassāyeva taṇhāya asesavirāganirodhā upādānanirodho;","sn35.113:2.14":"upādānanirodhā … pe … evametassa kevalassa dukkhakkhandhassa nirodho hotī”ti.","sn35.113:3.1":"Tena kho pana samayena aññataro bhikkhu bhagavato upassuti [upassutiṃ (sī. ka.)] ṭhito hoti.","sn35.113:3.2":"Addasā kho bhagavā taṃ bhikkhuṃ upassuti ṭhitaṃ.","sn35.113:3.3":"Disvāna taṃ bhikkhuṃ etadavoca –","sn35.113:3.4":"“assosi no tvaṃ, bhikkhu, imaṃ dhammapariyāyan”ti?","sn35.113:3.5":"“Evaṃ, bhante”.","sn35.113:3.6":"“Uggaṇhāhi tvaṃ, bhikkhu, imaṃ dhammapariyāyaṃ.","sn35.113:3.7":"Pariyāpuṇāhi tvaṃ, bhikkhu, imaṃ dhammapariyāyaṃ.","sn35.113:3.8":"Dhārehi tvaṃ, bhikkhu, imaṃ dhammapariyāyaṃ.","sn35.113:3.9":"Atthasaṃhitoyaṃ, bhikkhu, dhammapariyāyo ādibrahmacariyako”ti.","sn35.113:3.10":"Dasamaṃ.","sn35.113:3.11":"Yogakkhemivaggo ekādasamo.","sn35.113:4.0":"Tassuddānaṃ –","sn35.113:4.1":"Yogakkhemi upādāya, dukkhaṃ loko ca seyyo ca;","sn35.113:4.3":"Saṃyojanaṃ upādānaṃ, dve parijānaṃ upassutīti."},"attha":{"book":"Spk-iv","bookName":"Saḷāyatanavagga-aṭṭhakathā","vriCode":"s0304a.att","from":190,"to":193,"paras":[{"para":190,"vripara":"105-113","refs":["sn35.113:1"],"lines":["105-113. Dutiye vedanāsukhadukkhaṃ kathitaṃ, taṃ pana vipākasukhadukkhaṃ vaṭṭati.","Tatiye <b>dukkhassā</b>ti vaṭṭadukkhassa.","Catutthe <b>lokassā</b>ti saṅkhāralokassa.","Pañcamādīsu yaṃ vattabbaṃ siyā, taṃ khandhiyavagge vuttanayameva."],"lineRefs":[["sn35.113:1"],["sn35.113:1"],["sn35.113:1"],["sn35.113:1"]]},{"para":191,"vripara":null,"refs":["sn35.113:1"],"lines":["Yogakkhemivaggo ekādasamo."],"lineRefs":[["sn35.113:1"]]},{"para":192,"vripara":null,"refs":["sn35.113:1"],"lines":["Lokakāmaguṇavaggo"],"lineRefs":[["sn35.113:1"]]},{"para":193,"vripara":null,"refs":["sn35.113:1"],"lines":["1-2. Paṭhamamārapāsasuttādivaṇṇanā"],"lineRefs":[["sn35.113:1"]]}],"wordLinks":[]},"tika":{"book":"Spk-t-iv","bookName":"Saḷāyatanavagga-ṭīkā","vriCode":"s0304t.tik","from":196,"to":200,"paras":[{"para":196,"vripara":"105-113","refs":["sn35.113:1"],"lines":["105-113. <b>Vedanāsukhadukkhan</b>ti vedanāsaṅkhātaṃ sukhañca dukkhañca kathitaṃ.","“Ajjhattaṃ sukhaṃ dukkhan”ti vuttattā vimuttisukhassa ca saḷāyatanadukkhassa ca kathitattā vivaṭṭasukhaṃ cettha kathitamevāti sakkā viññātuṃ.","Kāmaṃ khandhiyavagge khandhavasena desanā āgatā, na āyatanavasena.","Ettha pana vattabbaṃ atthajātaṃ khandhiyavagge vuttanayamevāti."],"lineRefs":[["sn35.113:1"],["sn35.113:1"],["sn35.113:1"],["sn35.113:1"]]},{"para":197,"vripara":null,"refs":["sn35.113:1"],"lines":["Upādāyasuttādivaṇṇanā niṭṭhitā."],"lineRefs":[["sn35.113:1"]]},{"para":198,"vripara":null,"refs":["sn35.113:1"],"lines":["Yogakkhemivaggavaṇṇanā niṭṭhitā."],"lineRefs":[["sn35.113:1"]]},{"para":199,"vripara":null,"refs":["sn35.113:1"],"lines":["Lokakāmaguṇavaggo"],"lineRefs":[["sn35.113:1"]]},{"para":200,"vripara":null,"refs":["sn35.113:1"],"lines":["1-2. Paṭhamamārapāsasuttādivaṇṇanā"],"lineRefs":[["sn35.113:1"]]}],"wordLinks":[]},"tika2":null}
